{"version":1,"id":"staysolidrocky-party-girl","title":"Party Girl","artist":"StaySolidRocky","key":"F#m","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/staysolidrocky/party-girl/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: StaySolidRocky and Nashi","chords":[{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#m","canonical":"F#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"         Girls just wanna have fun","columns":34,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":3,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m","column":6,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D","column":26,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"So they party, so they party","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"(Ayy, yo, Nashi, you goin' crazy)","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Lil' mama a party girl, she just wan' have fun too","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"They say you ain't wifey type, but I don't care, I want you","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"She like to do drugs too, she in love with guns too","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"They say you too piped up, but I think that I love you","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":0,"beat